WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.217 --> 00:00:07.979
The two priests pushed the Tang Monk toward the enormous frying pan.

2
00:00:07.999 --> 00:00:20.445
"Stop!" cried priests stopped.

3
00:00:29.196 --> 00:00:30.877
The Great Immortal looked around.

4
00:00:32.117 --> 00:00:34.478
Wukong appeared and landed on the floor.

5
00:00:34.498 --> 00:00:36.779
"You came back!"

6
00:00:37.119 --> 00:00:37.980
cried the Tang Monk.

7
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:41.501
"I was here the whole time," said the monkey.

8
00:00:42.802 --> 00:00:44.602
gave Bajie a nasty look.

9
00:00:44.622 --> 00:00:47.103
"I didn't escape without you."

10
00:00:48.384 --> 00:00:50.505
Wukong turned to the Great Immortal.

11
00:00:50.525 --> 00:00:53.946
"Please don't harm the Tang Monk," he said.

12
00:00:54.887 --> 00:00:56.407
will fix your ginseng tree.

13
00:00:57.087 --> 00:00:59.584
But I need to get help."

14
00:00:59.944 --> 00:01:01.305
lying!" said Bajie.

15
00:01:01.325 --> 00:01:03.565
"He doesn't know how to fix the tree!"

16
00:01:05.486 --> 00:01:06.586
quiet, Bajie!"

17
00:01:06.866 --> 00:01:07.646
said Wukong.

18
00:01:07.666 --> 00:01:09.147
"I'm not lying!"

19
00:01:10.307 --> 00:01:12.408
The Great Immortal thought for a moment.

20
00:01:13.408 --> 00:01:14.548
"Okay, Wukong.

21
00:01:15.549 --> 00:01:19.290
I will give you until the end of the day to fix my ginseng tree.

22
00:01:20.230 --> 00:01:23.871
If you can't, the Tang Monk goes into the frying pan."

23
00:01:24.771 --> 00:01:26.192
The monk shook with fear.

24
00:01:27.788 --> 00:01:29.570
"Don't worry, Master," said the monkey.

25
00:01:30.290 --> 00:01:30.991
will find help.

26
00:01:31.611 --> 00:01:32.913
I'll be back as soon as I can."

27
00:01:33.933 --> 00:01:36.456
Wukong shot out of the abbey and was gone.

28
00:01:38.037 --> 00:01:39.178
Bajie shook his head.

29
00:01:39.198 --> 00:01:40.819
"We're doomed."

30
00:01:42.060 --> 00:01:45.663
Wukong soared through the air until he came to Mount Potalaka.

31
00:01:47.085 --> 00:01:51.008
Guanyin was meditating in her pagoda.

32
00:01:51.028 --> 00:01:54.151
"Bodhisattva!" cried the monkey.

33
00:01:54.171 --> 00:01:55.452
"I need your help!

34
00:01:56.220 --> 00:01:59.103
A Daoist named the Great Immortal is going to fry the Tang Monk.

35
00:01:59.843 --> 00:02:02.305
I have until the end of the day to fix his ginseng tree."

36
00:02:02.325 --> 00:02:05.448
"What happened to the tree?"

37
00:02:05.888 --> 00:02:06.689
asked Guanyin.

38
00:02:07.489 --> 00:02:09.871
She gave the monkey a suspicious look.

39
00:02:11.493 --> 00:02:14.615
"I, um, knocked it down," said Wukong.

40
00:02:14.635 --> 00:02:20.540
"That was a terrible thing to do, Wukong," said Guanyin.

41
00:02:20.560 --> 00:02:25.044
"The Great Immortal's ginseng tree is older than Heaven and Earth.

42
00:02:26.204 --> 00:02:27.564
It was a rare treasure."

43
00:02:28.425 --> 00:02:29.445
The monkey shrugged.

44
00:02:29.465 --> 00:02:30.505
"I was angry."

45
00:02:31.466 --> 00:02:35.147
"You must learn to control your anger," said Guanyin.

46
00:02:36.627 --> 00:02:37.847
bodhisattva stood up.

47
00:02:38.828 --> 00:02:40.988
She went to a shelf and grabbed a vase.

48
00:02:42.669 --> 00:02:46.170
"This vase is filled with magic dew," she said.

49
00:02:46.190 --> 00:02:51.691
"It can bring spirit plants, such as the ginseng tree, back to life."

50
00:02:54.120 --> 00:02:57.982
A short while later, Wukong and Guanyin arrived at the abbey.

51
00:02:59.843 --> 00:03:04.666
Guanyin told Wukong, Bajie, and Wujing to stand the tree back up.

52
00:03:06.967 --> 00:03:11.870
Guanyin rose into the air and poured the dew over the ginseng tree.

53
00:03:14.192 --> 00:03:18.454
As the dew droplets rolled over the branches, light sparkled.

54
00:03:20.075 --> 00:03:23.953
The tree's color came back, and new leaves and fruit grew.

55
00:03:25.194 --> 00:03:28.575
Soon the tree looked just as it had the day before.

56
00:03:29.876 --> 00:03:33.838
To thank everyone, the Great Immortal decided to host a feast.

57
00:03:33.858 --> 00:03:38.540
"I would like to share some ginseng fruit with everyone here," he said.

58
00:03:39.660 --> 00:03:41.561
Everyone went back into the abbey.

59
00:03:43.602 --> 00:03:46.884
The two priests brought in trays of ginseng fruits.

60
00:03:52.549 --> 00:03:54.029
"Mmm," said Bajie.

61
00:03:54.049 --> 00:03:57.272
"This fruit tastes wonderful if you eat it slowly."

62
00:03:58.432 --> 00:03:59.373
looked at Wukong.

63
00:03:59.393 --> 00:04:01.935
"Sorry I didn't believe you earlier."

64
00:04:03.115 --> 00:04:04.737
worry about it," said the monkey.

65
00:04:05.537 --> 00:04:06.958
He took a bite of his fruit.

66
00:04:08.159 --> 00:04:10.741
The Tang Monk looked nervously at his fruit.

67
00:04:10.761 --> 00:04:15.163
"It's safe to eat," Guanyin assured him.

68
00:04:17.125 --> 00:04:19.106
monk took a bite and smiled.

69
00:04:20.027 --> 00:04:22.516
He looked at the ginseng fruit again.

70
00:04:22.576 --> 00:04:24.818
"It doesn't look like a baby anymore," he said.

71
00:04:24.838 --> 00:04:29.101
The next morning the travelers headed west along the road.

72
00:04:31.743 --> 00:04:34.425
Weeks went by as they continued their journey.

73
00:04:36.867 --> 00:04:40.289
They walked through rain and sunshine, heat and cold.

74
00:04:42.771 --> 00:04:48.896
Up ahead, an evil spirit named Lady Whitebone sat by the side of the road.

75
00:04:49.840 --> 00:04:52.501
She had been waiting by the road for years.

76
00:04:54.202 --> 00:04:57.223
On this day she sniffed the air and smiled.

77
00:04:57.243 --> 00:05:01.184
"The Tang Monk is finally approaching.

78
00:05:01.204 --> 00:05:07.166
I will eat him up, and I will live forever!"
